From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] phytium: support OpenWrt builds on Linux 5.10 and 6.18

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

--- a/dc_driver/phytium/ftd330_fb.c
+++ b/dc_driver/phytium/ftd330_fb.c
@@ -194,8 +194,7 @@
